	"Author": "SoftPandaBoi",
	"Description": "This mod needs my other mod, Void Machines to get the Void Rabbits.\n<br />\n<br />Void Rabbits are some sort of dark opposite of Rabbits! Ever wondered what to do with a Rabbit's Foot? Well. This mod gives them more use! If you you put one into a Void Infuser (From Void Machines), it'll be converted into a Void Rabbit's Foot. A Void Rabbits Foot is a strange object, it's almost alive... And if you put it in an incubator, it'll slowly form a full Void Rabbit!\n<br />\n<br />Why would you want a Void Rabbit? \n<br />Well, they drop more Void Rabbit's Feet that you can sell and turn back into Rabbit's Feet, but due to how they metabolize food, they also commonly create Magma Geode's.\n<br />\n<br />This mod is another small part of a bigger project I'm working on.",
